  "limits": [
    "Static as-designed pin assignment and direct net membership only; not a firmware configuration or operating qualification.",
    "Power net peers are checked source-to-native, not independently enumerated in this contract.",
    "Wheel capture peers R118/R127 are series-resistor endpoints, not external sensors.",
    "Shared SPI needs bus ownership, modes, clock bounds, reset state and MISO-release verification.",
    "SDMMC four-bit use, pin matrix, boot straps, UART directions, I2C addresses and reset sequencing require firmware and datasheet qualification.",
